---
interface Props { articleUrl?: string }
const { articleUrl } = Astro.props;
const image = '/images/storagescope-tree.webp';
---
<section class="interface-showcase" id="interface" aria-labelledby="interface-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">LIVE WORKSPACE / 开发预览</span><h2 id="interface-title">看见目录，也看见变化。</h2></div>
    <span class="interface-source">真实桌面录制 · 隔离样本 · 无私人路径</span>
  </div>
  <figure class="interface-figure">
    <video class="interface-video" controls loop muted playsinline preload="none" poster="/images/storagescope-live-flow.webp" width="760" height="512" aria-label="StorageScope 开发预览：真实测试文件增长与缩减时，变化沿目录连线流动">
      <source src="/media/storagescope-live-flow.webm" type="video/webm" />
      <source src="/media/storagescope-live-flow.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      <a href="/media/storagescope-live-flow.mp4">打开目录变化演示</a>
    </video>
    <figcaption>点击播放：隔离目录中的真实文件增长、缩减触发尾迹和增减提示。页面默认静止，可随时暂停。演示来自开发预览；当前公开下载仍是 v0.3.0-beta.2。</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <ol class="interface-guide">
    <li><span class="guide-number">01</span><div><h3>边扫描，边看结构</h3><p>目录树逐步出现，未完成的统计会明确标注。</p></div></li>
    <li><span class="guide-number">02</span><div><h3>选中节点，直接定位</h3><p>详情、路径搜索和列表共用选择；双击进入，Esc 返回。</p></div></li>
    <li><span class="guide-number">03</span><div><h3>变化发生时，再流动</h3><p>增长流入、缩减退回；尾迹只掠过一次，无变化时静止。</p></div></li>
  </ol>
  <div class="interface-context"><p>流动表达逻辑空间的增减量，不是磁盘吞吐率。<a href={image} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">查看 Beta 目录树截图 ↗</a></p><a class="text-link" href="/writing/storagescope-live-workspace/">看本轮更新与验收 →</a></div>
  {articleUrl && <p class="interface-source"><a href={articleUrl}>继续阅读目录树的结构取舍 →</a></p>}
</section>
